                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "Looks fine to me.  It would need https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-debug-collector/+/79169 along with it to provide the well known names."
                },
                {
                    "file": "tools/dreport.d/plugins.d/dbusstats",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jayanth Othayoth",
                        "email": "ojayanth@gmail.com",
                        "username": "ojayanth"
                    },
                    "message": "Since dump usually gets collected in error scenarion. Need to look below use cases and see below uses case are not impacting dump collection. \nService Unavailability: The service might not be running or might be unresponsive.\nHigh Load: The system or the D-Bus service might be under heavy load, causing delays in processing the request."
                },
                {
                    "file": "tools/dreport.d/plugins.d/dbusstats",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kamat",
                        "email": "deepakkamat6630@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkamat27"
                    },
                    "message": "the call here is for the dbus service and if that is not responsive so we will get the busctl call failed error. I tried by adding the ExecStartPre=/bin/sleep 60 in the dbus service file and got call failed message which is expected as dbus service itself is not available.\nbusctl call xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Manager /xyz/openbmc_project/dump/bmc xyz.openbmc_project.Dump.Create CreateDump a{sv} 1 \"i\" i 1234\nCall failed: The service is temporarily unavailable."
                },
                {
                    "file": "tools/dreport.d/plugins.d/dbusstats",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kamat",
                        "email": "deepakkamat6630@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkamat27"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
